{"artifact_kind":"issue_comment","external_id":"issue_comment-4775373935","fetched_at":"2026-07-25T18:35:09.814290+00:00","raw":{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"If you were to use useMemo on createTranslateFunction in the example hook, it would look like this: \n\n``` jsx\nfunction useTranslate(getNamespace) {\n  const messages = useMessages();\n  const formatIcu = useIcuFormatter();\n\n  return useMemo(\n  () => createTranslateFunction(getNamespace(messages), formatIcu),\n   [getNamespace, messages, formatIcu]\n );\n}\n```\n\n\nMemoizing the result of`getNamespace(messages)` is redundant because we are just passing the result to createTranslateFunction, and we do not need to save the incremental values. ","created_at":"2026-06-23T03:40:34Z","html_url":"https://github.com/react/react/issues/36847#issuecomment-4775373935","id":4775373935,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react/react/issues/36847","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAJy2Ks8AAAABHKJsbw","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react/react/issues/comments/4775373935/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-06-23T03:40:34Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react/react/issues/comments/4775373935","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12485737?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellCohen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellCohen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellCohen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellCohen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MaxwellCohen","id":12485737,"login":"MaxwellCohen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNDg1NzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellCohen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellCohen/received_events","repos_url